  "text": "This ensemble brings a commanding presence to your office meetings. The structured black dress establishes a clean, professional silhouette that is both authoritative and sleek. To add an unexpected element of warmth and energy, the bright orange heels serve as a bold statement, while the matching orange belt introduces a deliberate pop of color to draw attention to your waist. A sophisticated dark brown bag grounds the look in rich textures, completing the palette without cluttering it.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "The orange shoes and belt create a perfect echo that draws the eye vertically, making you appear taller and elongating your entire figure."
  ],
