      "n": "#33·32",
      "text": "A timeless black dress in a sleek fabric, cut with a flattering V-neck and defined waistline that elongates your figure. The voluminous long sleeves add a touch of drama while maintaining professional elegance."
    },
    {
      "n": "#151·07",
      "text": "Striking orange patent leather pumps with a pointed toe and a sturdy block heel, finished with an ankle strap for secure wear. The glossy finish adds a luxurious contrast to the matte dress."
    },
    {
      "n": "#391·03",
      "text": "A versatile dark brown leather bag crafted from pebbled leather for depth of texture. It features a classic envelope flap closure secured by a polished metal clasp and includes an adjustable strap for versatile carrying."
    },
    {
      "n": "#213·05",
      "text": "A vibrant orange leather belt distinguished by its signature gold 'H' buckle, offering a statement of bold style that perfectly matches the shoes to unify your ensemble."
